# --- Dependencies / build output ---
node_modules/
*.log

# --- Copyrighted game data — NEVER commit (regenerated locally from your own disc) ---
# Decoded Konami tile graphics + disc-derived layout/palette data:
port/game/assets/**/*.bin
port/game/assets/**/*.json
# Reference framebuffers used only for offline scoring (derived from the game):
port/harness/targets/
# Decompression cache (derived from the disc):
port/build/.tile_blocks.json
# Any VRAM/state capture — banned from the port by design:
port/rendered/
**/state.bin
*.raw

# --- Local render/debug artifacts (rendered game screens = Konami visuals) ---
**/*.png
**/_preview_*
port/**/out/
*.ppm

# --- Disc-derived index/layout metadata (regenerated from disc) ---
port/build/.lzss_index.json
port/harness/konami_layout.json
port/harness/*_layout.json
